{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/d6733f85526ca67311ab8a076f9f1bc1.avif?t=1770885220\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/ec0490b70c6eb29afdaffb7721516fe4.avif?t=1770885220\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partake in epic battles with giant creatures as you attempt to defy the impossible against bosses of all different types, sizes and abilities. Can you make it through?<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/eeaf846260f0bd91ffa1019d935a983e.poster.avif?t=1770885220\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/eeaf846260f0bd91ffa1019d935a983e.webm?t=1770885220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/eeaf846260f0bd91ffa1019d935a983e.mp4?t=1770885220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/1388ee649c1fb39115d27a1e23e7a1b6.avif?t=1770885220\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through this journey of self discovery as you slowly unlock different memories in an attempt to unveil more about this mysterious world and your place in it<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/76f279310827e4aeb245c528cd60865f.poster.avif?t=1770885220\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/76f279310827e4aeb245c528cd60865f.webm?t=1770885220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/76f279310827e4aeb245c528cd60865f.mp4?t=1770885220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/210c089269afb8bbce44702d79425767.avif?t=1770885220\" width=800 height=150 /></span>Explore a world of secrets and ancient wonders as you unravel the truth about your estranged father in a personal, intimate story written by an indie developer <br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/599b89b41d2596d9c1c4897f1d5e42a9.poster.avif?t=1770885220\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/599b89b41d2596d9c1c4897f1d5e42a9.webm?t=1770885220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/599b89b41d2596d9c1c4897f1d5e42a9.mp4?t=1770885220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/a8e060ceafa7fdb1915837b23926c48f.avif?t=1770885220\" width=800 height=150 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi there! I am Jugraaj (a.k.a JSS Games) - the indie developer behind Norigin. The game initially started as a completely solo project during the limited hours I had after work. A few years in, I completely poured myself into the project. Currently I still work as an independent developer but occasionally collaborate with specific contractors on a ramp on/ramp off basis depending on production. My aim has always been to make this dream game a reality.\u00a0  <br>--</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don't forget to wishlist Norigin if you are interested in the game</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Join the mailing list to get regular updates &amp; become part of the Norigin &quot;Insider&quot; community!</i></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2135000?t=1770885220","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2135000?t=1770885220","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/6193c1b6c0fb068dca2c39ee913a56350e2c2f66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770885220","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/6193c1b6c0fb068dca2c39ee913a56350e2c2f66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770885220","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/d6733f85526ca67311ab8a076f9f1bc1.avif?t=1770885220\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/ec0490b70c6eb29afdaffb7721516fe4.avif?t=1770885220\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partake in epic battles with giant creatures as you attempt to d